Feature: TEST-SWR-NOTEBOOK-7-HANDLE-ALREADY-RUNNING-SERVER

  Background:
    Given user has running notebook server

  @tests:SWR-NOTEBOOK-7 @id:TEST-SWR-NOTEBOOK-7-EXISTING-SERVER
  Scenario: System handles requests when server is already running appropriately
    When Server is already running and user attempts to start another server
    Then System should log "Marimo server is already running" warnings
    And System should return existing server URL without starting new instance